<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tears of Faith</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">YAØ</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Tears of Faith</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">16ydiDJ9OyUuSMswFQ4WTZ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.988" end="00:17.755">Killing me slowly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.755" end="00:25.755">With this song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.787" end="00:30.310">It could get lonely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.310" end="00:37.580">In this made up happiness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.580" end="00:40.590">Why don’t you run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.590" end="00:44.370">I made a grave mistakes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.370" end="00:50.149">So much pleasure it turned into pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.149" end="00:53.173">Tears of faith</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.173" end="00:56.486">Hit the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.486" end="00:59.001">Let it wash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.001" end="01:02.262">Over me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.262" end="01:08.107">Why do we cry? (why do we cry)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.107" end="01:15.879">I guess you'll never know now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.879" end="01:20.644">Yeah this life made me so cynical</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.644" end="01:25.176">And it's for a reason</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.176" end="01:28.939">You're the reason why I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.939" end="01:34.711">Crash onto my knees and cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.711" end="01:37.220">To you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.220" end="01:40.733">Just like you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.733" end="01:43.821">Don't wanna run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.821" end="01:47.333">Cause the truth it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.333" end="01:55.333">So much pleasure it turned into pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.451" end="01:59.461">Tears of faith</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.461" end="02:02.751">Hit the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.751" end="02:05.017">Let it wash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.017" end="02:08.585">Over me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.585" end="02:14.374">Why do we cry? (why do we cry)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.374" end="02:18.136">I guess you'll never know now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.136" end="02:24.409">Never know now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.409" end="02:26.436">Behind the mask</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.436" end="02:30.714">I call a home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.714" end="02:36.990">These nights I'm learning to let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.990" end="02:40.990">I'll be waiting with all of your love</p></div></body></tt>